193
00:18:38.329 --> 00:18:41.958
Siguro ginamot ko siya
masyadong mabuti, higit sa nararapat.

194
00:18:59.433 --> 00:19:00.434
Si Mrs.

195
00:19:01.644 --> 00:19:02.687
Si Mrs.

196
